sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Profile UI
    participant PM as ProfileManager
    participant Current as Current profile
    participant Selected as Selected profile
    participant Storage as Storage manager

    User->>UI: Select profile B
    UI->>PM: switchProfile(profileB)
    PM->>Current: Save tabs and session state
    PM->>Storage: Flush profile A data safely
    PM->>Current: Pause or release runtime
    PM->>Selected: Load metadata and browser context
    PM->>Storage: Restore profile B storage
    Selected-->>PM: Restore session and tabs
    PM-->>UI: Active profile = B
    UI-->>User: Show profile B as active
